  "prefLabel": "Ec-Wst 104.01 Request for Access to Records",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ec-Wst 104.01 Request for Access to Records.\n\n(a) Any person requesting access to council records under RSA 91-A shall direct a request as specified in (b) below.\n\n(b) A request to access council records shall be in writing and:\n\n(1) Identify as particularly as possible the information being sought;\n\n(2) Be sent to the council secretary at the address specified in Ec-Wst 103.01(a).\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Ec-Wst 100) #13659, eff 5-23-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ec-wst100-200.html"
